Files:
- vision_fp16.onnx, text_fp16.onnx, tokenizer.json: fetched by the app from
  https://huggingface.co/CardAnvilModels/sam3-ONNX at commit 7eee2d79268e794e433b6e49467c5340525ac228 (not served
  by this site). ONNX format conversions of facebook/sam3 by Card Anvil, distributed by them under the SAM License;
  the tokenizer is copied unchanged from facebook/sam3.
- detector_fp32_nosign.onnx, detector_fp16_nosign.onnx (served by this site, in this folder): modified derivative
  works of facebook/sam3 (model.safetensors sha256
  6d06f0a5f84e435071fe6603e61d0b4cc7b40e0d39d487cfd4d67d8cc11cc14a, the same weights as the Card Anvil export).
  fp32: the DETR detector graph exported to ONNX by this project, then the Sign operators rewritten into equivalent
  arithmetic. fp16: Card Anvil's detector_fp16.onnx (same commit as above) with the same Sign rewrite. Scripts and
  commands: tools/models/ in this project's source repository. Distributed under the SAM License.
